[2] Clinical Biostats. (n.d.). Bayesian vs. Frequentist Inference: Key Differences. Retrieved November 8, 2026, from https://www.clinicalbiostats.com/tutorials/biostatistics/bayesian-vs-frequentist-inference-key-differences/

